          <li>Use automated systems (bots, scrapers) without our written permission</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any part of the Services</li>
          <li>Remove or modify any copyright, trademark, or proprietary notices</li>
          <li>Use the Services to transmit spam or unsolicited communications</li>
          <li>Harass, abuse, or harm other users</li>
          <li>Collect or store personal data about other users without consent</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
