          <li>Your account has been inactive for an extended period</li>
          <li>We are required to do so by law</li>
          <li>Continuing to provide the Services would create substantial legal or economic risk</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Effect of Termination</h3>
        <p>Upon termination:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your right to use the Services will immediately cease</li>
          <li>We may delete your account and User Content</li>
          <li>Any provisions of these Terms that should survive termination will remain in effect</li>
          <li>You remain responsible for any fees incurred before termination</li>
        </ul>
