        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
        <div class="contact-info">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@promptfull.com">legal@promptfull.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@promptfull.com">support@promptfull.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/contact">promptfull.com/contact</a></p>
